// This section is for RUMORS in the game.
// THESE ONLY GET USED BY THE RUMOR OPCODE
// start at 20000
// rumors start at rumor number * 20
// the first message is the logbook message
// all others are filled in based on NPC's social class

// Vormantown Rumors

{20000}{Rumor has it that Mr. Merton Vorman had a bastard, half-ogre son.  He's purportedly buried behind the Vorman Manor, in the family mausoleum.}
{20001}{Have you heard the rumors about Merton Vorman?  It’s said that the mausoleum behind his house holds his bastard, half-ogre son!}

{20020}{Rumor has it that something strange has happened in Ter'elon, an elven village located in the Erriwind Forest to the north.  Qin'ar, the leader of the village, has come to Vormantown to speak with Merton Vorman.}
{20021}{Word has come down from the Erriwind Forest…something strange has happened in the elven village of Ter'elon!  Qin’ar, their leader, has come here to speak with Merton Vorman!}

{20040}{Rumor has it that Veryk Ironwill, the king of the Stone Heart Clan, has come to Vormantown.  No one seems to know why.}
{20041}{Did you see who came into town?  Veryk Ironwill, the king of the Stone Heart Clan!  Word has it he’s staying up at Merton Vorman’s mansion, but no one knows why he’s here!}

{20060}{Rumor has it that Mr. Shackleford takes care of all of Mr. Vorman's personal affairs.}
{20061}{Have you met Mr. Shackleford?  He's Mr. Vorman's lawyer, and takes care of all of his personal affairs.  He's quite an individual!}

{20080}{Rumor has it that Merton K. Vorman founded Vormantown as some sort of "social experiment".}
{20081}{Mr. Vorman founded Vormantown almost 10 years ago...he called it a "social experiment", I think, but I don't know much about things like that...}
